  "description": "Prime Property is delighted to present number 207 Trimbleston to the market. An impressive three-bedroom house located in one of South Dublin's most reputable developments. This property provides bright and spacious accommodation which is presented in excellent condition throughout and further benefits from a sunny south-westerly facing rear garden and off-street parking.\n\nTrimbleston is a highly sought-after address enjoying a central location just off Goatstown Road within very close proximity of a host of amenities including local shops, leisure facilities, transport links, many of South Dublin’s most exclusive schools, UCD and Dundrum Town Centre. The villages of Dundrum, Stillorgan and Ranelagh are all just a short distance away offering a wide variety of shops, eateries and recreational facilities. The N11 and M50 are also within easy reach. Built by Sorohans and designed by McCrossan O’Rourke Manning, Trimbleston is a landmark development built to an excellent specification. The property enjoys a quiet position on a cul-de-sac to the rear of the development surrounded by meticulously maintained mature landscaping. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of an inviting entrance hall, generously proportioned living room with stove fireplace, light-filled kitchen/dining room opening out to the low maintenance rear garden, ample under-stair storage room, and guest wc. On the first floor are two large double bedrooms, one en-suite bathroom, and a family bathroom. Finally, on the top floor is an expansive principal bedroom with en-suite bathroom and small balcony which catches the morning sun. A large storage room and eaves storage cupboards complete the accommodation. There is designated over-ground parking immediately to the front of the property and a further designated underground parking space.\n\nThe property is vacant with no onward chain which represents an opportunity to purchase without risk or delay.",
